<section class="how-it-works section" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="how-it-works__header text-center">
      <span class="section-label">EMAGRECER</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Como o <span class="text-gradient">OzenVitta</span> te ajuda a emagrecer?
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        O OzenVitta atua diretamente nas principais causas do ganho de peso, ajudando você a conquistar o corpo dos seus sonhos de forma saudável.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="how-it-works__grid">
      <div class="benefit-card">
        <img 
          src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/01.png" 
          alt="Ícone" 
          class="benefit-card__icon"
          width="80"
        />
        <h3>Reduz a fome e o <br> desejo por doces:</h3>
        <p>Fibras de Chia e Psyllium prolongam a saciedade e reduzem o apetite.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <img 
          src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/02.png" 
          alt="Ícone" 
          class="benefit-card__icon"
          width="80"
        />
        <h3>Acelera o metabolismo <br>e queima gordura:</h3>
        <p>Ação da Laranja Moro e L-Carnitina.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <img 
          src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/03.png" 
          alt="Ícone" 
          class="benefit-card__icon"
          width="80"
        />
        <h3>Combate o inchaço e retenção de líquidos:</h3>
        <p>Ingredientes como Quitosana e Inulina regulam a digestão e reduzem o inchaço.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-card">
        <img 
          src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/04.png" 
          alt="Ícone" 
          class="benefit-card__icon"
          width="80"
        />
        <h3>Auxilia no aumento<br> da energia:</h3>
        <p>Componentes que irão dar mais vitalidade no dia a dia.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 48px;">
      <a href="#oferta" class="btn btn--primary">
        Quero emagrecer
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <img 
    src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/FLUT-1.png" 
    alt="" 
    class="floating-decoration floating--left animate-float"
    width="60"
  />
  <img 
    src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/FLUT-2.png" 
    alt="" 
    class="floating-decoration floating--right animate-float"
    style="animation-delay: 0.5s"
    width="80"
  />
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .how-it-works__header {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .how-it-works__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .benefit-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .benefit-card__icon {
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }

  .benefit-card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .benefit-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .floating-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .floating--left {
    left: 5%;
    top: 50%;
  }

  .floating--right {
    right: 5%;
    bottom: 20%;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .how-it-works__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .how-it-works__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .floating-decoration {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
